# `if` with a single statement, then the next statement indented deeper than the `if`: it looks guarded but is not.
misleading-indentation 11
# Properly aligned follow-up (line 14 at the `if` column): silent.
!misleading-indentation 14
# Single-line if, the next line indented under it (line 16 reads as guarded).
misleading-indentation 16
# while with one-statement body, next statement indented like the body.
misleading-indentation 19
# FP shape: begin..end body is a block; a later deeper line (24) is not this rule's shape.
!misleading-indentation 24
# FP shape: second statement on the SAME line (separate rule: multiple-statements-per-line).
!misleading-indentation 25
# FP shape: if/else chain has no dangling statement.
!misleading-indentation 27
!misleading-indentation 29
